  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original Requienia fossil-form interpretation with large attached curled left valve and shallow complete right valve. Nominal 60 mm maximum extent is artistic order-of-magnitude scaling, not three-axis specimen measurement; unobserved back, thickness, growth relief and palette inferred. Measured plane separation approximately 0.235 mm, not nominal 0.075 mm.",
